`rowt status` when the probe through the proxy gets no answer because curl's own
8 s ran out (exit 28): on a slow link (about 800 ms round trips in flight,
2026-10-19) the escape lane carried traffic while this line said the tunnel was
not reachable. It now says no answer within 8s, a slow link or a dead tunnel.
router-up's config and env, with www.google.com answering 000 / exit 28.
Siblings: status-dead-tunnel (000, exit 7: refused, still "tunnel not
reachable") and status-slow-local (exit 28 in local mode).
